{"server":"cn","storyId":"act32side_level_act32side_07_end","groupId":"act32side","stageId":"act32side_07","title":"安全出口","storyCode":"CR-7","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act32side/level_act32side_07_end.txt","sourceHash":"34642ffe60375f14d5e3f3ca02d8e58399aa178293b7c880de86ba5ae2be6750","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g2_galleriessquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"导火索，情况如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已净空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"守军相当懈怠，对我们的突袭毫无防备，我们也没给他们时间向上通报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做得好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是时候开始突袭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，行动务必要迅速，不要拖泥带水，不要给守军反应的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g5_galleries"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚外面是不是有什么响动？爆炸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懈怠的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该不会是那群疯子真的要闯进来吧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懈怠的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闯进来干嘛？营救雷内尔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懈怠的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别胡思乱想了，接好，这个好像是炎国的瓷器，一碰就碎，小心点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你刚刚打破玻璃罩子的时候差点连瓷器一起打碎了，还说我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说起来，刚刚队长打碎了个瓶子，说是上楼去找上尉报告，怎么到现在还没回来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懈怠的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概就和第一次来的时候一样，在爬楼梯吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懈怠的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不就是跟上尉商量给这些东西找下家的事，说不定两个人现在连自己腰包里能装多少钱都聊好了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"手雷已掷出！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g6_galleries_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已确认房间内没有人质！优先压制守军！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懈怠的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见鬼，怎么是你们？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懈怠的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，他们的连发铳威力不行！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我不是怕，我是想找个安全的地方呼叫增援——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想都别想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懈怠的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，准头倒不错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"懈怠的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜你们那破弹药威力太弱，中一下还不如被源石虫刺一下——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"胆怯的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，怎么是你们？你们这帮疯子还真的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们当然是来真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾拉，那句话怎么说的来着，已净空？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"干得漂亮，但下次得提前跟我们说一声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生、双月，你们继续往龙舌兰给出的大批人质被困方向移动，务必确保人质安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果形势不妙就不要轻举妄动。我带领其余成员扫清一楼守军之后，立刻去和你们会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亚兹，特克诺，我们走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亚兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这些艺术品，米诺斯的雕塑《投标枪的帕拉杜利斯》，炎国的珐琅彩鎏赤金转心瓶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有乌萨斯大作家谢尔盖·卡塔耶夫的原稿......让我看看是他的哪一部......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......《耳机漏电，心中的烂泥》。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见鬼，雷内尔收藏的居然是这一部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他和马特奥真是各有各的混蛋，一个要炸毁，一个要倒卖......简直......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，整理就交给之后来的家伙们。我们先走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别、别过来！我不会给你开门的！你进来我们就同归于尽——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（抓挠门板的声音）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"声音、声音停下来了，她走了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧啧，这桥段够吓人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这片子叫什么来着......哦，《艺术馆惊魂：萨科塔夺命追杀》，导演还是个住在哥伦比亚的萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得把大反派设计成萨科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来雷内尔雇的保安平时也没什么事做，只能坐在这儿一边看录像带，一边想象艺术馆里发生点什么离奇杀人案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事做还不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上尉觉得能干的都到楼下搬东西去了，我们这些平时就不招他待见的，反而可以安安稳稳坐在这儿当看守——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":true,"text":"楼下出事了！你们知道什么情况，赶快报告！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":true,"text":"楼下有铳声和爆炸声，六楼的人都听见了，你们怎么回事，瞎了还是聋了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的军人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）叫你把音量调小点，你偏不听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）闭嘴吧你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我立刻跟楼下联系！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——啧，还真打不通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":true,"text":"能打通我还问你们吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":true,"text":"立刻给我搞清楚楼下到底怎么了！有人闹事就给我揍，有人打进来了就给我赶出去！一切以艺术品装车优先！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别去，史嘉朵，别去！下了楼的人一个都没有回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个萨科塔女人已经疯了！我亲眼看见她杀了一个公共厕所里的所有人，还想要我们所有人的命！"},{"type":"narration","text":"伴着电视里传来的阵阵尖叫，七八个军人在狭小的控制室里面面相觑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g7_galleriesstaircase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好消息，控制室里的看守们没发现我们的无人机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"室内的大多数人质被吓得不轻，似乎还被守军抢劫了一番，但至少没有伤亡情况，情绪也还算可控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"守军已经发现楼下情况不对，刚刚应该在和上级通话，但显然没人愿意离开貌似安全的控制室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"确实是好消息。你继续监视他们，我联系艾拉，我们商量一下对策。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":true,"text":"喂？加比，情况如何？楼下到底出了什么乱子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被排挤的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我......我......不知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么不知道，这都多长时间了，别磨蹭了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被排挤的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我、我只是......留意周围状况，现在才到楼梯间门口！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说话的声音都打颤了！该不会是被恐怖片给吓到了吧，哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"被排挤的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":true,"text":"胡说！再说......再说你自己怎么不来！你们总是这样，一有什么工作就推给我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？加比？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"加比？？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行，我们不能再放任何一个人下楼了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们没在监控上看到吗？！那个萨科塔女疯子甚至没碰她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她只是冲着电话开了一铳，正在接电话的史嘉朵就变成了一摊......一摊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（啜泣声）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":true,"text":"到底什么情况，搞清楚了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"报告，我们派去侦察的人......突然没了回应......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":true,"text":"废物！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上、上尉，要不你派其他人去一楼，我们......我们真的腾不出人手......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"马特奥","speakerId":"avg_npc_1210_1","isRemote":true,"text":"没回应就继续派人下去，否则我到一楼之前先去二楼毙了你们！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g7_galleriesstaircase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都别动！滚出来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好......没人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"派出来侦察的人一个一个的都不见了，一楼是不是在......在闹鬼啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别胡思乱想了，先睡一会儿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊恐的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？拉蒙？拉蒙，你、你说句话啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又断线了......这已经是......第四次了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四次，四个人......每次都是，一下楼就......"},{"type":"narration","text":"没人接话。\n终端被扔在房间一角，偶尔能隐约从里面听见上尉的怒吼声，但已经没人去回应了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许是我们每次都只派一个人，成了一个一个送——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你每次想让几个人去送死啊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个萨科塔疯女人，心理变态，杀人狂，她、她......她就在门口！她在透过门禁的摄像头对着我笑啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梅奥，把对讲机挂回去就好，她进不来的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她用铳对准我了！她......她要扣扳机了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那她也只能打坏摄像头！你冷静一点！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（铳声）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎、怎么会......梅奥......死了？铳伤？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呀啊啊啊啊啊啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......要不......还是......换盘带子看吧。"},{"type":"narration","text":"两人用涣散的目光对视了一会儿，疲惫的军人起身，走到控制室一角，随便抓起一盘录像带塞进录像机里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......让我们欢迎今天的嘉宾，从卡西米尔来的“艺术投资商”，多索雷斯的文化产业新秀，雷内尔·科瓦尔斯基先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你放这个干什么，你有病啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不知道这盘带子是电视台的录像啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶紧换一盘！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈喽哈喽~新观众初次见面，老观众一天不见！我是这档节目的主持人，你们的尤里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算我求你，再换一个，这主持人吵得我头疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总共就这么三盘带子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这个保安平时就只看这三盘带子吗？！他有精神问题吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天的节目呢，是为所有第一次来到多索雷斯的游客们准备的特辑......"},{"type":"narration","text":"疲惫的军人果断按下了弹出按钮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1272_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是把那部电影看完吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些......魔族佬......制裁的时候......到了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、我、我警告你，我爷爷是卡兹戴尔的大人物！你死都不会想见识他的巫术的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，哈哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你别笑得那么阴恻恻的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈......巫术......哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"毙命之时！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"双子分身复制器启动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_i06"},{"type":"narration","text":"房间中央传来窸窸窣窣的响动。\n一名嘴唇紧咬、浑身颤抖、双手紧扣的军人把视线从屏幕上移开，战战兢兢地回过头去。\n他看见了一个凭空出现在房间里的......怪异的女人。\n他看见那个女人的面色和她的头发一样苍白。\n他看见那个女人用见所未见的大型铳械对着自己，不用穿过摄像头，蚀刻弹立刻就能穿过自己的心脏。\n他看见那个女人尽管站在那里，却又好像不在此处，仿佛完全没在呼吸。\n他看见那个女人头上顶着......\n光环。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别回头，别回头......因为我就在你的......身后......！！"},{"type":"narration","text":"回头的军人发出一声短促的哀鸣，引得其他人神经质地顺着他的目光看去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别、别给我装神弄鬼！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"军人觉得自己射中了，可弩箭没有受到任何阻碍，维持着划过空气的轨迹，从那个女人的身体中间直直穿过。\n女人就那么凭空消失了，只有头上光环的残影还——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"吓破胆的军人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呀啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"报告上尉，是萨科塔！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"敌人是会空间移动法术的萨科塔，是个心理变态，杀人狂，会隔着摄像头用铳杀人——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷懒的军人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"已净空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"已净空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不觉得仅仅是在双子分身复制器受到攻击的同时，关个灯就能引发这么大的恐慌......"},{"type":"narration","text":"而房间角落的电视里，破门的萨科塔还在屏幕里大开杀戒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"电视里的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杀！杀！杀！我要把你们的角割下来，挂在教皇厅顶上当风铃呀！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g6_galleries_b"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投资界新人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"太感谢你们了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投资界新人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"要是你们有任何关于艺术品投资方面的需求，请务必让我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特克诺","speakerId":"avg_npc_1212_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别废话了，赶紧滚蛋！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"投资界新人","speakerId":"avg_npc_223","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区琴师","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你怎么背着个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"这个人因为反抗被揍了一顿，现在头还发晕，我背着他快一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区琴师","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不错啊，这些人里居然也有硬骨头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区琴师","speakerId":"avg_npc_499_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顺便，这就是克里斯达尔艺术馆的二号展厅，你要看的手稿看到了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，一直在疏散人群，把这事给忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"手稿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"米诺斯诗人的手稿，传单上说是二号展厅里的“镇厅之宝”的那个，你知道在哪吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚看到过一眼，在展厅另一侧，我可以带你过去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"那麻烦你指路了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的贵族","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先生，你可以把我放下来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是还头晕嘛！指路就行，我背着你更快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"展厅里的人质已经快疏散完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏你的双子分身复制器，过程顺利得吓人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"双月","speakerId":"avg_4124_iana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）我也没想过事情会这么凑巧，本来只是个诱饵罢了。我还以为他们会像之前的社区居民那样把火力都倾泻在分身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能说你的分身站了个好位置，而那几个守军选了一部打发时间的好片子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艺术馆外的守军也已经全部肃清。我们接下来怎么办？去三楼救埃内斯托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那个——那个......总之不许再靠近那边了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，米沃什先生。原来你没和雷内尔在一起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情况紧急，有什么多余的话之后再说，你需要尽快离开艺术馆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不打算从我这里拷问出什么有用的情报？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没那种习惯，更没那个时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望做个交易，一些情报我给你们，我希望你们得到这些情报后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能把雷内尔救出来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米沃什先生，如果没有雷内尔布置的炸弹，这场恐怖袭击或许根本不会成立。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雷内尔一个人是没办法把炸弹布满整座艺术馆的，他只不过是提出想法而已，实际执行者是谁，你应该知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道炸弹的时限，也知道该如何最有效率地将它们拆除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你打算以此来要挟我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么会。你们不是会受人要挟的那种人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只希望我的合作态度能为他争得一线生机。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，讲讲你知道的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们布设的是定时炸弹，起爆时间是今天上午十点钟，要让计时停下，你们需要处理起爆线路的四个节点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四个节点一个在地下室，一个在三楼的一间暗室里，一个在六楼的楼梯间，还有一个在雷内尔自己的办公室通风井里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......听起来有几分真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地下室里那个节点最大也最复杂，我推荐你们出一个人和我一起去——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"导火索","speakerId":"avg_4126_fuze_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和你去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那好，特克诺，你带领其他人继续搜寻可能躲藏起来了的受害者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"迪亚兹、空爆，你们把三楼和六楼的两个节点分头处理掉，我、医生和双月继续向更高层突破，给拆除顶楼的节点争取更多时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三楼的暗室比较难找，虽然基本就在这个展厅正上方，但要过去很麻烦，我需要纸笔画一下路线图——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"不用了，我来就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"空爆","speakerId":"avg_282_catap_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃内斯托！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙舌兰","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那间暗室交给我和阿莱塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"六楼的那个节点在楼梯间里，有一面看起来不大对劲的墙，很容易就能打破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交给我了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，终于来了，就差你们俩了。怎么样，看到手稿心情如何——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，等等，怎么变成你背着他了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"窘迫的贵族","speakerId":"avg_npc_492_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......他一看到手稿就哭得上气不接下气，最后好像直接哭得昏过去了，只好换我把他背过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昏过去了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，医生！快过来！这里有人昏倒了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，就是哭昏过去了，应该是看到了朝思暮想的手稿，情绪过度激动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"医生","speakerId":"avg_4125_rdoc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让他去通风的地方休息一会儿就好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"社区画家","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......艾拉小姐，这就是我所有的底牌了，我全部交出来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我们失败了呢？如果根本无法把他救出来呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......我就留下来陪他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾拉","speakerId":"avg_4123_ela_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米沃什","speakerId":"avg_npc_1213_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望在那之前你能把其他人都救走，艾拉小姐，我不想有多余的人在这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"48_g7_galleriesstaircase"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，已经把金属外壳卸下来了，里面总共连着——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——米沃什，你这疯子，爆炸点足足有十二处！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？地下室里那个节点连了四十多个？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，这笔账之后再算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在只要把线路一条一条地拧下去就好了，对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，嗯。知道。拧的时候尽快，半连接状态下炸药容易失控。我懂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾拉，你们那边如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迪亚兹","speakerId":"avg_npc_1214_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四楼还有几个抵抗的？嗬。"},{"type":"narration","text":"迪亚兹不再说话，抹了一把额头上的汗，专心对付手头乱成一团的电线。\n拧得要快，拧下之后把接头也拧下来，用阻隔材料封住线头，免得短路。\n他恍惚想起，以前在辛嘉斯当兵的时候，自己做的从来都是把接头拧上去——\n迪亚兹皱起眉头，咂了咂嘴，手上不停。那些事和现在没关系，他现在只是个正在排爆的消防员而已。\n线路已经拧得差不多了，还差两个就可以完全解除此处的爆炸风险。\n他已经摸清了这种接头怎么拧最快，前半段下压，慢拧，后半段只要用全力把接头转下来就行。\n离拧下倒数第二个接头只差七圈，六圈，五圈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1273_1","isRemote":false,"text":"把那老混蛋给我抓住！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"两个上尉的手下提着刀朝着老消防员的方向快步跑来，楼上则架起了三把弩。\n老消防员拧接头的手僵在原处无法动弹，一时竟不知道是该正拧还是反拧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
